WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.280
This regular meeting of the Miami Special Utility Authority for today's date,

00:00:04.719 --> 00:00:09.380
item number two on the agenda is invocation by the pastor of Activate Church, David Jackson.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:10.460
David, thanks for being here.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:14.859
Let's have a word of prayer.

00:00:16.699 --> 00:00:19.399
Jesus, just thank you for the gift of life, Lord.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:20.660
Thank you for our community.

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:26.719
Thank you for these men and women who offer their time and their service to guide us and lead us, Lord.

00:00:26.719 --> 00:00:31.059
I just pray that you give them wisdom, give them cooperation and harmony with each other.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.200
Let our community be in unity together.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:42.619
And let us move forward down the road of progress and building a strong community, Father.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.920
We ask these things in the name of Jesus Christ.

00:00:45.299 --> 00:00:45.520
Amen.

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:46.179
Amen.

00:00:46.659 --> 00:00:47.679
Please join me in the pledge.

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:52.640
I pledge allegiance to the flag of the United States of America

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:55.420
and to the republic for which it stands,

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:56.560
one nation,

00:00:56.719 --> 00:00:57.520
under God,

00:00:57.799 --> 00:00:58.560
indivisible,

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:00.579
with liberty and justice for all.

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:02.740
Thank you.

00:01:02.759 --> 00:01:03.299
Thank you, David.

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:10.200
Item number four is public input and unscheduled personal appearances.

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:14.019
Anyone that wishes to address the authority on any of the agenda items?

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:22.280
There being none, item five is claims.

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:24.359
